\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5.5}{\ignorespaces The 5{,}120-byte query head on all 3{,}080 official Banking77 rows. Following amendment 1 to the pre-registration, the encoder starts from the 1{,}024-position 113.47M checkpoint and is fine-tuned jointly with the query head for 3{,}000{} steps at sequence 5{,}120 and batch 8{} (1.69{} GPU-hours); the separate masked-LM length adaptation was not run. The head uses the same 4{,}000 rows and the exact stored 24 BM25 example ids as the native-window head. ``Examples'' is the mean number of complete lines in the 5{,}118-byte context budget. The old head and its native 1{,}020-byte packing are unchanged controls, reused from the native-window evaluation with their per-example context hashes checked. The P0 bar is Jev's 92.40\%. Wilson intervals are 95\%; McNemar is exact and two-sided; the bootstrap lower bound is the 5th percentile of 10{,}000 paired resamples, seed 0. Read from \texttt  {results/jev\_query\_5120/eval/summary.json}.\relax }}{42}{table.caption.29}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:len5120}{{5.5}{42}{The 5{,}120-byte query head on all 3{,}080 official Banking77 rows. Following amendment 1 to the pre-registration, the encoder starts from the 1{,}024-position 113.47M checkpoint and is fine-tuned jointly with the query head for \LenSteps {} steps at sequence 5{,}120 and batch \LenBatch {} (\LenHeadHours {} GPU-hours); the separate masked-LM length adaptation was not run. The head uses the same 4{,}000 rows and the exact stored 24 BM25 example ids as the native-window head. ``Examples'' is the mean number of complete lines in the 5{,}118-byte context budget. The old head and its native 1{,}020-byte packing are unchanged controls, reused from the native-window evaluation with their per-example context hashes checked. The P0 bar is Jev's \LenJevPct \%. Wilson intervals are 95\%; McNemar is exact and two-sided; the bootstrap lower bound is the 5th percentile of 10{,}000 paired resamples, seed 0. Read from \texttt {results/jev\_query\_5120/eval/summary.json}.\relax }{table.caption.29}{}}
