\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.4}{\ignorespaces Train/test separation for the joint 5{,}120-byte fine-tune. The bars show 96.62\% on the 4{,}000 training rows (3{,}865/4{,}000) and 87.11\% on the 3{,}080 official test rows (2{,}683/3{,}080), with 95\% Wilson intervals. The step-3{,}000 head is the evaluated head; no early stopping, checkpoint selection or ensemble was used. The dashed line is Jev's 92.40\%. The test--train gap is 9.51{} points. The vertical axis begins at 80\%. Values are recomputed from the stored summary by \texttt  {thesis/gen\_figures.py}.\relax }}{45}{figure.caption.32}\protected@file@percent }
